<html lang='ko'>
  <head>
    <meta charset='utf-8' />
    <title>조직 등록 알림 / Organization Registration Notice</title>
    <style>
      body{ font-family: 'Malgun Gothic', Arial, sans-serif; background:#f4f4f4; margin:0; padding:0; color:#333; line-height:1.6; }
      .container{ max-width:600px; margin:0 auto; background:#fff; border-radius:8px; box-shadow:0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }
      .header{ background:#2f855a; color:#fff; text-align:center; padding:30px 20px; border-radius:8px 8px 0 0; }
      .header h1{ margin:0; font-size:24px; }
      .header h2{ margin:8px 0 0 0; font-weight:400; font-size:16px; }
      .content{ padding:30px 20px; }
      .summary{ background:#f8f9fa; padding:20px; border-radius:6px; border-left:4px solid #2f855a; }
      .footer{ background:#f8f9fa; border-top:1px solid #e9ecef; padding:20px; text-align:center; font-size:14px; color:#6c757d; border-radius:0 0 8px 8px; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class='container'>
      <div class='header'>
        <h1>조직 등록 알림</h1>
        <h2>Organization Registration Notice</h2>
        <p style='margin-top:18px'>새로운 조직 등록 설명이 접수되었습니다.<br />A new organization description has been submitted.</p>
      </div>

      <div class='content'>
        <div class='summary'>
          <strong>조직 정보 / Organization Details</strong>
          <p><strong>조직명:</strong> {{meta.organizationName}}</p>
          <p><strong>설명:</strong><br />{{meta.organizationDescription}}</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class='footer'>
        <p><strong>학생문화공간위원회 / Student Cultural Space Committee</strong></p>
        <p>조직 등록 설명 접수 사실을 안내드립니다.<br />This message notifies you of a new organization description submission.</p>
        <p style='margin-top:15px;color:#999;'>문의: scspace@kaist.ac.kr</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
